    feat: Enhance autofixer with Mend JSON parsing and secret management
    
    - Added MendJSONParser for parsing Mend JSON API response files, extracting vulnerabilities and relevant details.
    - Introduced SecretsManager to handle GitHub and Azure DevOps tokens from environment variables or Azure Key Vault.
    - Updated RemediationEngine to support input files (PDF, JSON) and integrate with new parsers.
    - Enhanced GitOperations to use authenticated URLs for cloning repositories with GitHub tokens.
    - Modified GitHubClient to operate in demo mode, returning mock PR URLs for testing.
    - Updated main.py to accept input file paths for processing.
    - Improved logging throughout the code for better traceability and debugging.

